month!  (Now I know what happened to my games this past weekend.)

This bug MUST be patched! 3.0 is not complete without this fix!
Please, someone fix it and apply it to the pre-compiled IBM-PC version.
Thank you very much.  (I won't play it under a full moon anymore, unless
I know for damn sure that my luck is positive--which is not often.)

